<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS6" title="In IV Experiments ‣ BATR-FST: Bi-Level Adaptive Token Refinement for Few-Shot Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-F</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Ablation Study</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In BATR-FST: Bi-Level Adaptive Token Refinement for Few-Shot Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">V </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Conclusion</span></span></a></li>
